Subject: Springleaf Drum: let the default AI cast it
Why: AiController.chooseSpellAbilityToPlay drops every card marked AI:RemoveDeck:All from the
  candidate plays unless Flat Monte Carlo is on (`isCardRemAIDeck(h) && !flatMc`), so with the
  default AI the Drum was never even considered (Azorius Momo, baseline round robin: seen in 230
  games, cast in 0). The AI can use it once cast: ComputerUtilMana pays a mana ability's
  "tap an untapped creature" cost through checkTapTypeCost / chooseTapType, which taps the
  lowest-power untapped creature. Removes the hint; nothing else changes.
Measured: PENDING (filled in from the before/after gauntlets).

